Z||000000||fierodave||02-27-2000||04:40 AM||||INDY Update!<P>Well the outside of the car is done!<BR>It Turned out a bit better than I expected,<P>The decals took about 4 hours though! worth the time.  <P>All that's left is the new brakes, headliner, new drivers outer seat bolster, interior assembly, trunk carpet,     <BR>I think I will put a new windshield in it too! (can't put the windshield decal on a pitted windshield) and front shocks (shocks are good just look like hell)  <P>I will get a few shots of the car out side when weather permits so it will be a white instead of yellow car! (lights in shop make it look yellow)<BR>well thanks for the space<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17004104&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17004104&Sequence=2</A>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17004149&Sequence=6" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17004149&Sequence=6</A>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17004232&Sequence=3" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17004232&Sequence=3</A>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17003776&Sequence=6" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17003776&Sequence=6</A>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17003216&Sequence=5" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17003216&Sequence=5</A>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17003216&Sequence=5" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=2037909&p=17003216&Sequence=5</A> ||||reg||12
